# Protected contract paths.
#
# These files define or protect approved architecture, product and UI contracts
# (docs/decisions/README.md → Authority model). This list is also the input to
# scripts/contract-guard.mjs: a commit or pull request that changes any of them
# must carry a `Contract-Change:` line.
#
# GitHub requires a code-owner review for these paths only when branch protection
# on `main` enables "Require review from Code Owners". Without that setting this
# file only requests a review; it blocks nothing.

